Development Roadmap

Implement data cleaning

Implement product normalization

Define product hierarchy and category filtering

Implement baseline exact and fuzzy matching

Prepare manually labeled product pairs

Implement a machine-learning matching model

Evaluate accuracy, precision, recall, and F1 score

Test the complete pipeline using retailer datasets

Prepare a working demonstration for academic review

